<%# An adventurer's nameplate (rank-tiered: E copper, D iron, C silver, B gold with a glow, A mithril with a pulsing aura and sparkles, S adamantite with a turning rune ring and embers). Locals: name, letter (E to S), optional size ('lg') and nameId. The rank seal inside keeps the letter for every reader. Every value goes through the escaped output tag. Never put an EJS tag inside an EJS comment: it breaks parsing. %>
<span class="nameplate<%= typeof size !== 'undefined' && size ? ' np-' + size : '' %>" data-plate="<%= letter.toLowerCase() %>"><span class="np-aura" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="rank-seal seal seal-sm np-gem" data-plate="<%= letter.toLowerCase() %>" aria-hidden="true"><%= letter %></span><span class="np-name"<% if (typeof nameId !== 'undefined' && nameId) { %> id="<%= nameId %>"<% } %>><%= name %></span></span>
